3,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about how often our plans slipped when the weather or roads turned against us.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about how our building locations and opening hours determine who can actually reach us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate when we pretend old projects never happened. I want to see what actually worked before we pick something new.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect the funding structure is the real culprit, not the size of the budget.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I am worried that we keep adding new duties without checking if the staff actually have the skills to handle them.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, the roads are a real barrier. I wonder if our hours match when people can actually travel safely.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, exactly. If the roads close, our hours become meaningless. I need to see if our schedule aligns with safe travel windows.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, funding is important, but I think we are ignoring the past. We need to check the records of the two programmes from six years ago.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, I agree. But I suspect the funding shape, not the size, is the real issue. I will check the grant terms.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, I agree. We need to know if the skills for those old programmes are still on the roster. I will check the volunteer register.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Minako, that is wise. If the skills are gone, the new duties will just add stress. I will look at the winter road closures.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, that is a valid concern. I will examine the bus links in the outer wards to see if our hours match their schedules.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Minako, yes, skills matter. But I really need to see the attendance sheets from the old outreach stops. Did people actually show up?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, attendance is vital, but I suspect the money dried up before the project did. I will check the running and equipment lines.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the equipment lines might show if we are over-relying on specific staff. I will check the supervision training records to see who is actually qualified.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I will also look at the quoted delivery windows from suppliers. If parts arrive late, our plans slip further.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use. That tells me when people actually need us to be open.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I will also check the two programmes begun six years ago. I need to see the final reports to know if they actually succeeded or just stopped.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the county grant terms and the endowment. I need to see if the funding is structured to last or just to look good on paper.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will also check the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. I need to know if the community has the skills to support new duties without straining our staff.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
